#: scenario9:scenario9_BFFABA15_63BD_40FC_B8ED_40BF543856FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e61390d51902353169aad240a95ecfc34770c8545ff531038fae60dc68e811a4
