msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_BFFABA15_63BD_40FC_B8ED_40BF543856FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do you know who I am?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私のこと……、⟪k:1⟫分かりますか……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_1E9F04AC_24CD_462E_9AC3_D4184EABDCD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2c3e2528569415d69fea877efb0746beb3cfc0bcf60ae3afaaa183fb4a871a0
#. default-sha256: c9325b7fa6cf85a35f6747b7963fb26c58110b1482bb566a01804240b3806c6d
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_1E9F04AC_24CD_462E_9AC3_D4184EABDCD7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And why... ⟪k:1⟫can I not speak?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうして……、⟪k:1⟫話そうとしても……、⟪k:2⟫何も言えないんだ……？"

#: scenario9:scenario9_FDA1CBD3_AAFE_4D07_AB73_5CB3BF3EE90A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a804280f0338690f876cdba120bc5419937b915ec3b638db968a124f8a10764f
#. default-sha256: fdb03c0c90df99d7e7e91eab59bb5caf24b38980f5aec05850a402e57a4ee0ad
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_FDA1CBD3_AAFE_4D07_AB73_5CB3BF3EE90A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was able to return to this gathering place of souls thanks to your efforts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたが……、⟪k:1⟫モルガーナの死の真相を暴いてくれたことで……、⟪k:2⟫私も魂の集うこの場へと戻る"
"ことが出来ました。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_D024F237_3183_4E5B_BE81_82AD558E0E75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2e74728330c980e89fb1ed170494e7ca9931379a47f4dc74f02fb7acdd6864a
#. default-sha256: 4779912f34b4dcea75d80d888dbe0e4539a1d799bd6eae47621ec7f21632a882
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D024F237_3183_4E5B_BE81_82AD558E0E75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But my heart told me I had to do this now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど……、⟪k:1⟫この瞬間でないと、⟪k:2⟫駄目だと思ったのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_74D6CBEA_B305_4027_B19E_4D301A77EACC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04ee9900c2339a670cb0104504475c9075bf8c9f7df192abb6437356b87e1274
#. default-sha256: 2553c7dfffcb0a5125798166ffa1cd7d2db7bd5bb4ccfd17aed2f3e36dd5a4d8
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_74D6CBEA_B305_4027_B19E_4D301A77EACC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have brought you here to ask for your assistance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなたに、⟪k:1⟫お願いがあって、⟪k:2⟫この場へと呼びました。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6BA1FB6E_E41D_48FA_90FD_50C8BA4E5933
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 076290c5ba7db296603bfb63537d4fdef1b6e599061823996fef79430662f1e2
#. default-sha256: 0cb476903411b83268238c5795ef3107577640eacb55d4118ca3f9265515469d
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6BA1FB6E_E41D_48FA_90FD_50C8BA4E5933"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫take this blade, and with it, extinguish my soul."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この剣で、⟪k:1⟫私の魂を滅ぼして欲しいのです。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_46C9FD96_4824_4A8E_B09A_005FD2D06FB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5054cf98017aad813e79f79a87188dfeee897f695d67faff832c1c8f3348eca8
#. default-sha256: dd5a16ff3115db3d4d289bcb23ce82ea162364458c84fcae4aa311c327bf2c9e
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_46C9FD96_4824_4A8E_B09A_005FD2D06FB3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because I wanted to save every last person caught in this tragic quagmire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この不幸の渦から……、⟪k:1⟫助け出すために……、⟪k:2⟫動いてきたんだ……。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_EB0AB613_6210_4CB4_B8ED_D5CAAEC5535D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7773993f585ad0407676dc04937a89c7641bf2c295c8cf82ae2c304e57c96f43
#. default-sha256: 56ae37ccef589396dfac2e520cfa5ff351888bafffa3016b6a0bfa0532a01d8d
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_EB0AB613_6210_4CB4_B8ED_D5CAAEC5535D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You can’t tell me that after everything you’ve seen...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫you haven’t realized that I "
"have no place in their lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫過去の彼らの関係を見て……、⟪k:1⟫私という者の異質さが……分かったのではありませんか。"

#: scenario9:scenario9_B62E9CEB_A857_4BDC_8BC4_DE2D0B129191
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
